---
// Home page hero. Lifted styling cues from Tailcast's hero section
// (gradient title, eyebrow above, two CTAs).
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container-page py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-6">Senior contract DevSecOps engineer</p>

      <h1 class="title-display hero-gradient mb-6 leading-[1.05]">
        Secure Cloud platforms<br />for AI and data workloads.
      </h1>

      <p class="body-muted max-w-2xl text-lg">
        25 years in IT, the last seven focused on Microsoft Azure &mdash;
        Terraform, Azure DevOps pipelines, Entra ID, Front Door + WAF,
        Defender for Cloud &mdash; with AWS and GCP work earlier in my career.
        Available for freelance engagements where security and platform
        engineering matter from day one.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:alex@harvtech.co.uk" class="btn-primary text-base">
          Get in touch
        </a>
        <a href="/showcase" class="btn-secondary text-base">
          See the showcase
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
